+It lists the third-party components that are actually contained in this installer
+(Linux .deb packages built 2026-10-23 with --enable-mpl-subset), states which license we
+elect for components offered under more than one license, and reproduces the license texts
+that are required but are not present in LICENSE / LICENSE.html.
