+
+The Thai spelling word lists are distributed as plain-text Hunspell files (.dic/.aff), which
+are their preferred form for modification. For reference, the source code offered above also
+contains the filter script used to derive them from their upstream sources and the list of
+words removed from the LibThai data; that script relies on intermediate data that is not
+distributed and does not regenerate the files on its own.
